# --- .easignore addendum ---
# This file REPLACES .gitignore for EAS uploads (and is the only filter under
# EAS_NO_VCS). Keep it a superset of .gitignore's sensitive entries.
.git

# Agent tooling and scratch dirs. In .gitignore but had drifted out of here,
# so they were being uploaded — verified with `eas build:inspect --stage
# archive`.
#
# NOT prompts/ — it is git-tracked runtime input, not scratch: the triage jobs
# read prompts/automation/*.md on the worker, and `eas workflow:run` packages
# the local directory through THIS file. Excluding it makes every dispatched
# run die with ENOENT on the prompt files (triggered runs clone from git and
# never noticed).
.agents/
.argent/
.codex/
.expo-code-review/
SETUP-TRACING.md

# `.claude/` is filtered selectively rather than wholesale: workflows execute
# scripts from `.claude/skills/*/scripts/`, and a blanket exclusion made those
# vanish from the archive with only a bare "No such file or directory" at step
# start — which reads like a path typo, not an exclusion.
#
# Excluded because it is local-only or has no use on a builder:
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/commands/

# `prompts/` is NOT excluded. The automation reads its agent prompts from there
# at runtime (see .eas/agent-work/agent-work.ts), so excluding it made every
# prompt-driven workflow fail with ENOENT on the prompt file.

# Triage artifacts the automation generates at runtime. These can carry
# customer crash and feedback content, so they must never reach a builder.
.eas/crash-triage/crash.json
.eas/crash-triage/ANALYSIS.md
.eas/feedback-triage/feedback.json
.eas/feedback-triage/ANALYSIS.md
.eas/feedback-triage/PUBLIC_REPORT.json
.eas/feedback-triage/PUBLIC_PR.json
.eas/agent-work/issue.json
.eas/agent-work/ANALYSIS.md
.eas/agent-work/PUBLIC_FINDINGS.json
.eas/agent-work/sim/
.eas/pr-review/feedback.md
.eas/pr-review/RESPONSE.md
.eas/pr-review/ACTIONS.json
.eas/public-evidence-site/dist/
.eas/crash-triage/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/crash-triage/RESCUED_WORK.md
.eas/feedback-triage/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/feedback-triage/RESCUED_WORK.md
.eas/agent-work/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/agent-work/RESCUED_WORK.md
.eas/pr-review/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/pr-review/RESCUED_WORK.md
.github/pr-review/

# Not needed to build the native app, and together ~80% of the archive.
# web/ is the standalone euxy-web marketing package (no workspaces,
# unreferenced from src/).
web/

# Only the heavy part of docs/ is excluded. docs/design/screenshots is 6.0M of
# the 6.2M; the markdown is 180K and the design agent reads it at runtime to
# ground itself in the visual language, so excluding docs/ wholesale left it
# designing from source files alone.
docs/design/screenshots/
